          "expr": "sum(rate(recall_llm_fallbacks_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", job=\"tutor-agent\"}[1h])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(recall_llm_fallbacks_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", job=\"tutor-agent\"}[1h])) + sum(rate(recall_quizzes_graded_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", job=\"tutor-agent\"}[1h])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Rough share of work served by the fallback model. clamp_min keeps this from dividing by zero when idle. Approximate on purpose: there is no counter for 'model calls attempted', so graded answers stand in for successful primary-model work."
